<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hatti</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Hatti was the ancient name for the land of central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a> that formed the core of the Hittite kingdom. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bronze-age">Bronze Age</a> it was a major power competing with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mitanni">Mitanni</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egypt">Egypt</a>. Hittite attacks from Hatti led to the defeat of the Mitanni Empire.</p></div>
